DESCRIPTION:Close your eyes. Let that little voice take control... Welcome 
 to the world's first ventriloquial hypnotherapy session. Lachlan Werner ('F
 unniest new ventriloquist on the block' **** Telegraph) and Brew the Witch 
 ('Star' **** Chortle.co.uk) sleep talk through an hour of (gay) skeletons i
 n closets\, Punch and Judy love songs (gay)\, clinically depressed (gay) fr
 at bros\, and a man called Ray (sexually ambiguous). Brew's lived inside th
 e shadows of Lachlan's head for 26 years\, now she's inviting you to purge 
 your subconscious with award-winning\, 'unhinged\, extraordinary' **** (Gua
 rdian) talent. 'The definitive queer puppet show' **** (LostInTheatreland.c
 o.uk).\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/lachlan-werne
 r-sleeper-hit-wip/
